    // which is not this contract. To make the property meaningful for all inputs, we consider two cases
    // depending on whether the provided 'asAdmin' boolean indicates that the caller is the recorded deployer
    // (the harness ensures some executions where asAdmin is true by deploying C from this test harness wrapper).
    // We model attempts and record whether the call reverted.

